hout paying a separate class charge.","evidence_claim":"FGCU states that group fitness classes are free for currently enrolled students, are drop-in, and offer registration 24 hours in advance.","source_url":"https://www.fgcu.edu/university-recreation-and-wellness/fitness/groupfitness","source_title":"Group Fitness","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free for currently enrolled FGCU students; consult the current schedule and use FGCU Go for advance registration.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fgcu-aquatics-center-open-swim","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"FGCU Aquatics Center","title":"Meet Up for an Open Swim","subtitle":"Student swimming at the campus Aquatics Center","notes":"Review open-swim and lane availability before walking over, then bring your Eagle ID and adjust plans if lightning closes the pool.","short_summary":"Use a free student recreation benefit for lap swimming or a low-key pool meetup.","evidence_claim":"FGCU says graduate students enjoy free access to its aquatics center, while the recreation site publishes current open-swim periods.","source_url":"https://www.fgcu.edu/graduatestudies/gradstudentlife","source_title":"Graduate Student Life","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free student access is documented by FGCU; bring an Eagle ID and confirm current open-swim hours and weather status.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fgcu-rec-well-center-workout","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"University Recreation & Wellness Center","title":"Plan a No-Cost Workout","subtitle":"Student fitness access inside FGCU’s recreation center","notes":"Meet at the recreation center for a self-directed workout, carrying your Eagle ID and checking facili