age to confirm the next date, then circulate among research, internship, leadership and community-engagement displays.","short_summary":"See student projects from across campus at FGCU’s free annual showcase.","evidence_claim":"FGCU describes Eagle X as an annual student-project showcase that is always free and open to the community.","source_url":"https://www.fgcu.edu/eaglex/","source_title":"Eagle X","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Always free and open to the community; the university lists the next event for April 16, 2027 and advises checking back for details.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fgcu-urecwell-rides","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"URecWell Rides","title":"Catch a URecWell Ride","subtitle":"Free student rides to destinations around campus","notes":"Watch for the yellow URecWell golf cart on its periodic campus rounds, flag it down, and join the short wellness conversation en route.","short_summary":"Turn a trip across campus into a brief, free wellness-learning activity.","evidence_claim":"FGCU says URecWell Rides gives students free transportation to any campus location and explicitly states that all rides are free.","source_url":"https://www.fgcu.edu/university-recreation-and-wellness/wellness/","source_title":"Prevention & Wellness","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free for students when the yellow outreach cart is operating; service runs randomly several times per month and is not on demand.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fgcu-wellness-wednesday","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Wellness Wednesday","title":"Try a Wellness Wednesday Activity","subtitle":"A weekly student outreach table with a rotating game or activity","notes"